          %h3#affine_integration Affine integration
          %p For 1-cojet differential 1-forms satisfying a weak sublinearity condition, there is an equivalent definition of the genuine integral that is more obviously parametrization-invariant.
          %p
            A 1-cojet form can be considered as a function on tangent vectors
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
